  "whyTopTier": "A 25 s teaser with no product UI: code drawn as glowing mono text on a 3D plane, the camera drifting over it while red markers flag lines, green ones replace them and a 'Merge' button lights. Then a glowing serif pun card, 'Think diff', and 'Code reviews: available soon in Linear'.",
