  "classify": "Abstract motion-graphics teaser for an unreleased feature. Conventions: perspective code planes, diff colours as story, a pun title card, 'available soon'.",
  "diagnose": [
    {
      "observation": "Red gutter markers, then green rows, then a lit 'Merge'.",
      "principle": "Semantic colour as narrative: the diff's own red/green code tells problem → fix → merge with no copy."
    },
    {
      "observation": "Static code on a tilted plane with a slow drifting camera.",
      "principle": "Parallax and depth create motion when the subject itself doesn't move."
    },
    {
      "observation": "The pun card fades through blur over about 4 s.",
      "principle": "Pacing: the slowest moment in the film is the line of copy, not the product."
    },
    {
      "observation": "Half the film (12.7 s) is cards and logo.",
      "principle": "A teaser's job is the name and the date; the picture is mood."
    }
